WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 5=

01:08.760 --> 01:09.960
(Yuehui Pavilion)
I told you to stop outsiders.

01:10.120 --> 01:11.160
Are you deaf?

01:11.420 --> 01:13.880
Since your ears are so useless,
we might as well cut them off.

01:13.920 --> 01:15.160
Young Lady, have mercy.

01:21.240 --> 01:22.520
Which palace

01:23.160 --> 01:24.480
are you from?

01:25.480 --> 01:26.920
Fourth Young Lady, please calm down.

01:28.400 --> 01:29.600
Ruyan

01:29.610 --> 01:32.500
was just recently bestowed the title
of Lady of Gentleness by His Majesty.

01:35.240 --> 01:36.320
Lady of Gentleness?

01:38.440 --> 01:39.400
You cannot hit me.

01:39.500 --> 01:41.220
My sister is
Lady Liu of Bright Deportment.

01:43.280 --> 01:44.640
So what if she's Lady Liu?

01:45.120 --> 01:47.120
My father is the Duke.

01:47.440 --> 01:49.040
And my sister is the Empress.

01:49.280 --> 01:50.640
Trying to compare status with me?

01:50.880 --> 01:52.320
Who gave you the nerve?

01:55.720 --> 01:57.440
By the Empress's decree,

01:57.440 --> 01:59.380
anyone who disrupts
the grand dance performance

01:59.560 --> 02:00.760
shall be executed immediately.

02:03.600 --> 02:04.840
As for you,

02:05.400 --> 02:07.080
you can add some color

02:07.160 --> 02:08.200
to my green silk.

02:20.680 --> 02:21.800
Hit her harder!

02:33.800 --> 02:35.220
I thought she was something special.

02:35.320 --> 02:37.190
But she can't even
dodge this simple bullying.

02:38.600 --> 02:40.240
Didn't Your Majesty notify the Empress?

02:40.480 --> 02:41.960
Why hasn't Her Majesty arrived yet?

02:42.520 --> 02:44.440
Your Majesty, are you not going
to intervene?

02:56.560 --> 02:59.080
Nangong Xuanyu is the most powerful

02:59.480 --> 03:00.720
and most heroic man

03:00.960 --> 03:02.880
in the world.

03:06.210 --> 03:07.600
I suppose the Empress isn't coming.

03:08.840 --> 03:10.000
Go and tell them to stop.

03:10.360 --> 03:12.520
Lady of Bright Deportment has arrived.

03:13.800 --> 03:15.120
Stop this at once.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.320
It seems I don't need to help.

03:23.040 --> 03:24.440
She can handle the harem on her own.

03:29.640 --> 03:32.720
Jiang Wanning, how dare you use
private torture in the palace?

03:33.160 --> 03:34.120
I...

03:34.300 --> 03:35.360
I have the Jinfeng Token.

03:35.560 --> 03:36.240
How insolent!

03:37.040 --> 03:38.800
You dare to be so arrogant before me?

03:43.440 --> 03:46.880
Today, I'll see exactly
how you plan to hit me.

03:56.280 --> 03:57.040
Forget it.

03:57.720 --> 04:00.240
You aren't worthy of being
handled by me personally.

04:01.840 --> 04:02.680
Someone, come.

04:03.280 --> 04:05.640
Send the Fourth Young Lady Jiang
to the Empress's palace.

04:07.160 --> 04:08.520
What if I refuse to go?

04:08.880 --> 04:10.880
Then I shall invite
the Empress's carriage

04:10.880 --> 04:12.040
here to the Shanglin Garden.

04:12.920 --> 04:13.960
You!

04:18.320 --> 04:18.880
Let's go.

04:23.800 --> 04:24.640
Young Lady...

04:27.120 --> 04:28.360
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

04:29.960 --> 04:31.120
Shen Zhinian,

04:31.920 --> 04:33.920
I saved you this once today.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.600
I might not next time.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.080
Put away your little tricks.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.160
In this palace,

04:43.800 --> 04:45.320
the more schemes you have,

04:45.800 --> 04:47.200
the shorter your life will be.

05:01.200 --> 05:01.920
Liu...

05:12.400 --> 05:14.240
Finally, the planting
is almost finished.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.080
Young Lady,

05:24.240 --> 05:25.920
everyone in this palace is a predator,

05:26.080 --> 05:27.200
ruthless and cruel.

05:27.560 --> 05:29.080
You have such a weak personality.

05:29.080 --> 05:31.120
How are we ever going
to survive in this palace?

05:32.560 --> 05:33.600
It doesn't matter.

05:34.080 --> 05:35.520
These are just superficial wounds.

05:36.880 --> 05:37.560
Come.

05:37.660 --> 05:39.290
There's important
business to take care of.

05:39.400 --> 05:40.720
You're already injured like this.

05:40.720 --> 05:41.820
What else do you need to do?

05:42.080 --> 05:42.880
To vent my anger.

05:43.560 --> 05:44.520
Today's grievance

05:44.920 --> 05:45.920
will be settled today.

05:49.320 --> 05:50.280
Are you alright?

05:56.280 --> 05:57.680
Who is it?

05:58.200 --> 05:59.040
Who's there?

05:59.040 --> 05:59.920
Stop hitting me.

06:02.200 --> 06:02.720
Who is it?

06:04.480 --> 06:05.840
Who's that?

06:05.840 --> 06:06.960
Are you alright, Young Lady?

06:10.680 --> 06:13.760
Why is it always me who gets hurt?

06:15.800 --> 06:17.760
We have no grudge against Liu Ruyan.

06:17.760 --> 06:19.200
Why would she do this?

06:20.060 --> 06:22.520
Women in the palace will
make things difficult for each other

06:22.520 --> 06:23.990
before they gain the Emperor's favor.

06:24.320 --> 06:26.640
If even the Empress
and Lady Liu are like this,

06:27.200 --> 06:29.000
it's even more so for
someone like Liu Ruyan.

06:30.920 --> 06:32.920
Senior Attendant,
a letter was found at the door.

06:43.220 --> 06:46.700
(Jianyue Pavilion,
Shanglin Garden. Zhen.)

06:47.320 --> 06:50.120
(If he hadn't left me alone
in the liquor cellar,)

06:50.320 --> 06:52.400
(none of this would be happening.)

06:55.520 --> 06:56.320
I'm not going.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.800
Your Majesty,

06:59.100 --> 07:01.230
the Empress has removed
her hairpin to plead for mercy.

07:01.240 --> 07:03.670
She brought Jiang Wanning
and has been kneeling for 15 minutes.

07:03.680 --> 07:04.840
Her Majesty's health is already poor.

07:04.840 --> 07:05.900
If she continues to kneel,

07:06.320 --> 07:07.680
I'm afraid her body won't hold up.

07:08.160 --> 07:09.960
If Duke Zhen uses
this to stir up trouble,

07:10.280 --> 07:12.040
Your Majesty might be harassed again.

07:12.360 --> 07:13.600
This kneeling display of hers

07:14.400 --> 07:15.760
isn't meant for me to see.

07:18.640 --> 07:20.360
(Yuehui Pavilion)
I was lenient in disciplining my sister.

07:20.360 --> 07:21.490
She has made a grave mistake.

07:21.720 --> 07:23.160
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

07:29.440 --> 07:31.200
I was lenient in disciplining my sister.

07:31.440 --> 07:32.600
She has made a grave mistake.

07:32.960 --> 07:34.280
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

07:41.040 --> 07:42.040
Your Majesty.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.320
Your Majesty.

07:45.760 --> 07:46.520
Your Majesty.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.720
Your Majesty,

07:52.120 --> 07:53.460
His Majesty asks that you return.

07:53.600 --> 07:55.240
This is
Fourth Young Lady Jiang's matter,

07:55.600 --> 07:56.990
and it has nothing to do with you.

07:57.560 --> 07:59.640
I watched her grow up.

08:00.120 --> 08:01.080
If she is at fault,

08:01.320 --> 08:02.760
it means I didn't teach her well.

08:04.640 --> 08:05.440
Your Majesty,

08:06.680 --> 08:08.560
for my sake,

08:08.960 --> 08:10.960
please let Wanning
kowtow and apologize to you.

08:11.400 --> 08:12.320
Your Majesty,

08:13.960 --> 08:15.280
I know my mistake.

08:15.920 --> 08:17.360
I won't dare do it again.

08:18.480 --> 08:19.240
Come in.

08:20.600 --> 08:21.360
Your Majesty...

08:28.160 --> 08:29.600
Whether His Majesty can forgive you

08:29.880 --> 08:31.000
depends on your attitude.

08:31.600 --> 08:33.160
You must apologize sincerely.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.400
Otherwise, even I can't help you,

08:35.410 --> 08:37.380
and you'll have to
return to the Jiang residence.

08:37.560 --> 08:38.760
I can't go back.

08:38.960 --> 08:40.280
Father would beat me to death.

09:03.080 --> 09:03.760
Your Majesty,

09:03.880 --> 09:05.000
I know my mistake.

09:05.160 --> 09:06.590
I beg for Your Majesty's forgiveness.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.280
Your Majesty,

09:10.600 --> 09:11.960
Wanning knows she was wrong.

09:12.280 --> 09:14.960
For my sake and my brother's,

09:15.120 --> 09:16.880
please let Wanning stay by my side.

09:17.320 --> 09:19.320
Let her accompany me
through my final days.

09:22.760 --> 09:23.800
Jiang Wanning,

09:24.080 --> 09:25.640
since the Empress has pleaded for you,

09:26.000 --> 09:27.880
I will forgive you this once.

09:28.280 --> 09:29.400
Thank you, Your Majesty.

09:52.640 --> 09:53.880
It's getting late.

09:54.960 --> 09:56.520
Escort the Empress back to her palace.

10:16.200 --> 10:18.240
I know why Father
wanted you to enter the palace,

10:18.680 --> 10:20.600
but there was no need to be so hasty.

10:21.320 --> 10:22.600
I protected you today,

10:23.200 --> 10:24.440
but I'm afraid His Majesty

10:24.960 --> 10:26.160
won't favor you.

10:27.000 --> 10:28.280
What if

10:29.080 --> 10:30.680
I conceive an imperial child?

10:32.600 --> 10:33.960
With just you?

10:34.840 --> 10:36.120
Without me,

10:36.680 --> 10:38.040
you couldn't even get near him.

10:39.560 --> 10:41.120
You were near him,

10:41.180 --> 10:43.200
yet you haven't given
birth to a single child.

10:43.400 --> 10:44.200
You...

10:46.440 --> 10:47.480
Fourth Young Lady Jiang,

10:47.920 --> 10:49.200
Her Majesty is so ill,

10:49.520 --> 10:51.560
yet she stayed up
this late for your sake.

10:51.680 --> 10:52.720
Instead of being grateful,

10:52.960 --> 10:54.280
you're upsetting Her Majesty.

10:54.720 --> 10:56.080
I can no longer control you.

10:56.800 --> 10:57.520
Shun,

10:58.040 --> 10:59.000
let's go.

11:09.760 --> 11:12.160
(I put a whole bottle
of Love Potion in it.)

11:12.520 --> 11:13.480
(I don't believe)

11:13.480 --> 11:15.200
(the Emperor can resist it.)

11:30.400 --> 11:31.840
The tea is drugged.

11:33.280 --> 11:35.640
What audacity.

11:44.240 --> 11:46.880
I'm here to serve Your Majesty.

11:55.760 --> 11:56.480
Your Majesty...

11:59.600 --> 12:00.400
Jiang Wanning,

12:00.560 --> 12:01.600
for your insubordination,

12:01.610 --> 12:02.830
you are expelled from the palace.

12:02.840 --> 12:04.720
You shall never set foot
in the palace again.

12:05.040 --> 12:05.680
Your Majesty,

12:05.680 --> 12:06.920
come back!

12:17.540 --> 12:21.220
♪Moon sets on palace walls,
breeze hits the gates♪

12:21.240 --> 12:22.680
Your Majesty.

12:24.260 --> 12:30.140
♪Falling at first sight,
a life of turmoil wasted♪

12:31.230 --> 12:37.380
♪Dim lamps, concerns unheard by anyone♪

12:37.940 --> 12:43.860
♪All the spring colors
lean toward one person♪

12:44.890 --> 12:48.940
♪Faint rouge hides
the tenderness in the eyes♪

12:49.920 --> 12:51.080
Your Majesty.

12:52.660 --> 12:55.860
♪Flowers wither easily,
but obsession remains♪

12:56.020 --> 12:59.660
♪The world is gentle
only because of you♪

12:59.660 --> 13:02.620
♪In the palace, through dawn and dusk,
who keeps a lamp burning♪

13:02.780 --> 13:08.780
♪Time silently scars those left behind♪

13:18.100 --> 13:23.220
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:24.940 --> 13:30.180
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:31.820 --> 13:34.180
♪If we don't meet♪

13:34.380 --> 13:37.620
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:37.820 --> 13:44.340
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:44.700 --> 13:51.140
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:51.500 --> 13:57.820
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:58.340 --> 14:05.020
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

14:05.020 --> 14:11.900
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

14:12.140 --> 14:18.020
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

14:18.940 --> 14:25.540
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:25.700 --> 14:32.380
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

14:32.660 --> 14:39.100
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
